{"id": "4cbf52eb-39c2-4ca5-af52-adfa010ddffe", "slug": "nodal-autonomous-relays", "title": "Nodal — Autonomous Relays", "description": "Nodal Autonomous Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nodal — Autonomous Relays\"\ndescription: \"Nodal Autonomous Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#050505\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#ECECEC\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nodal — Autonomous Relays\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 14; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated, charts.\n## Overview\nNodal Autonomous Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSystem Active // V.2.4 Nodal Infrastructure Security Changelog Authenticate Deploy Automated Routing Protocol Sift the static. Direct the current. Connect your active architecture. Nodal captures incoming feeds, parses…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Sift the static. Direct the current..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #050505, accent #FFFFFF, background #FFFFFF, surface #ECECEC, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nodal — Autonomous Relays</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #050505;\n            color: #ececec;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n        ::selection {\n            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n            color: #ffffff;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            display: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Typography utilities */\n        .mask-wrap {\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        /* Subtle technical grid glow */\n        .grid-glow {\n            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-white/20 font-light\">\n\n    <!-- Foundational Image Layer -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 bg-[#050505]\">\n        <!-- Full-bleed architectural/abstract photography -->\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop\"\n             alt=\"Architectural structure\"\n             class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-40 mix-blend-luminosity scale-105 transform origin-center\"\n             id=\"hero-bg\">\n\n        <!-- Directional Wash Overlays for readability -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#050505] via-[#050505]/70 to-transparent\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#050505] via-[#050505]/20 to-[#050505]/40 pt-32\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQiPgo8cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iNCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI0IiBmaWxsPSIjZmZmIiBmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMDIiLz4KPC9zdmc+')] opacity-20 mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Interactive Canvas Field (Subtle Technical Atmosphere) -->\n    <canvas id=\"ambient-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[1] pointer-events-none opacity-40\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Cinematic Corner Laser Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"laser-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[2] pointer-events-none opacity-90 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Visible Structural Grid Scaffold -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-10 pointer-events-none flex justify-between px-6 md:px-16\">\n        <!-- Left Outer Rail -->\n        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-white/[0.05] relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-24 -left-[3px] w-[7px] h-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 -left-[3px] w-[7px] h-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Center Guide (Desktop) -->\n        <div class=\"hidden md:block w-[1px] h-full bg-white/[0.02]\"></div>\n        <!-- Right Outer Rail -->\n        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-white/[0.05] relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-24 -right-[3px] w-[7px] h-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 -right-[3px] w-[7px] h-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Horizontal Top Horizon Line -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-24 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-white/[0.05]\"></div>\n        <!-- Horizontal Bottom Baseline -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-white/[0.05]\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Micro-labels -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-28 left-8 md:left-20 z-20 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/30 pointer-events-none transform -rotate-90 origin-top-left\">\n        System Active // V.2.4\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Sparse Top Navigation -->\n    <header class=\"fixed top-0 w-full px-6 md:px-16 h-24 flex items-center justify-between z-50\">\n        <!-- Logo -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <div class=\"w-6 h-6 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:programming-linear\" width=\"14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-white/80\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-white/90\">Nodal</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Links -->\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs tracking-wider text-white/50 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Infrastructure</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs tracking-wider text-white/50 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Security</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs tracking-wider text-white/50 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Changelog</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- Actions -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden sm:block text-xs tracking-wider text-white/50 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Authenticate</a>\n            <!-- Translucent button with thin border -->\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-wider overflow-hidden bg-black/40 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-md hover:bg-white/5 transition-all duration-500\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-0 bg-white/5 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-700 ease-out\"></div>\n                <span class=\"relative z-10 text-white/90 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    Deploy\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all\"></iconify-icon>\n                </span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content: Anchored Layout -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-30 w-full min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-end pb-32 px-6 md:px-16 pt-32\">\n\n        <!-- Grid scaffold container for content alignment -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 md:gap-8 items-end\">\n\n            <!-- Anchored Left Column: Primary Typography -->\n            <section class=\"md:col-span-7 lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col\">\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-8 gsap-fade\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white/40 animate-pulse\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-medium text-white/40\">Automated Routing Protocol</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Clean, confident sans-serif headlines -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-white/95 mb-8\">\n                    <div class=\"mask-wrap\"><div class=\"gsap-reveal\">Sift the static.</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"mask-wrap\"><div class=\"gsap-reveal text-white/50\">Direct the current.</div></div>\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-normal text-white/50 max-w-md leading-relaxed mb-12 gsap-fade\">\n                    Connect your active architecture. Nodal captures incoming feeds, parses intent, and compiles accurate responses—letting you restore vital mental capacity.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- Restrained Actions -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-6 gsap-fade\">\n                    <button class=\"group relative px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden border border-white/20 bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-md text-white/90 hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors duration-500\">\n                        <!-- Small moving highlight sweep -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 -left-[100%] w-[50%] h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent group-hover:left-[200%] transition-all duration-1000 ease-in-out\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                            Begin Sequence\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:plain-2-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-white/50\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-white/30\">\n                        <span>Compatible with</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-3 text-white/40\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:letter-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Anchored Right Column: Supporting UI Overlay -->\n            <section class=\"md:col-span-5 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8 relative gsap-fade-up\">\n\n                <!-- Lightly framed, low-fill supporting card -->\n                <div class=\"relative bg-[#050505]/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 p-6 md:p-8 grid-glow\">\n                    <!-- Subtle corner markers -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-white/30\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-white/30\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Interface Header -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-white/[0.05] mb-6\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-white/40 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-scan-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                            Feed Capture\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] text-white/20 font-mono\">ID: 719.4</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Thread Simulation -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\">\n\n                        <!-- Inbound Message -->\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-white/60\">\n                                S\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/80\">Sarah Vance</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-white/30\">14:02 UTC</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed\">\n                                    Checking the recent rollout parameters. Are we still confirmed to run the server transition before the scheduled lockdown?\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Additive AI Response Line -->\n                        <div class=\"relative pl-12\">\n                            <!-- Vertical connecting line -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-[15px] top-[-20px] bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                            <div class=\"bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.05] p-5 relative overflow-hidden group\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[2px] bg-white/20 group-hover:bg-white/50 transition-colors\"></div>\n\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-bolt-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-white/60\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-white/60 font-medium\">Response Compiled</span>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <div class=\"text-sm text-white/70 font-mono leading-relaxed opacity-80\">\n                                    Sarah,<br><br>\n                                    Confirmed. Transition sequences are locked for Friday 02:00 UTC, leading the lockdown by 48 hours. I will track the diagnostics.<br><br>\n                                    Nodal\n                                </div>\n\n                                <div class=\"mt-5 flex gap-3\">\n                                    <button class=\"text-xs bg-white text-black px-4 py-2 font-medium hover:bg-white/80 transition-colors\">Execute</button>\n                                    <button class=\"text-xs text-white/50 px-4 py-2 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white/90 transition-all\">Modify</button>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Secondary Metric floating near the card -->\n                <div class=\"absolute -right-6 md:-right-12 bottom-12 border border-white/10 bg-[#050505]/80 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-3 hidden lg:flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-white/40\">Confidence</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-mono text-white/90\">99.4%</span>\n                </div>\n\n            </section>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- Technical Atmosphere Canvas ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('ambient-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let lines = [];\n        let width, height;\n\n        function resizeCanvas() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            initLines();\n        }\n\n        function initLines() {\n            lines = [];\n            for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n                lines.push({\n                    y: Math.random() * height,\n                    speed: 0.1 + Math.random() * 0.2,\n                    opacity: 0.02 + Math.random() * 0.05,\n                    height: 1 + Math.random() * 2\n                });\n            }\n        }\n\n        function drawAmbient() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            lines.forEach(line => {\n                ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${line.opacity})`;\n                ctx.fillRect(0, line.y, width, line.height);\n\n                line.y -= line.speed;\n                if (line.y < -10) {\n                    line.y = height + 10;\n                }\n            });\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(drawAmbient);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);\n        resizeCanvas();\n        drawAmbient();\n\n        // --- Cinematic Corner Laser Canvas ---\n        const laserCanvas = document.getElementById('laser-canvas');\n        const lCtx = laserCanvas.getContext('2d');\n        let lw, lh;\n\n        function resizeLaser() {\n            lw = laserCanvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            lh = laserCanvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resizeLaser);\n        resizeLaser();\n\n        let laserTime = 0;\n\n        function drawLasers() {\n            lCtx.clearRect(0, 0, lw, lh);\n\n            // Emitter locked to bottom center\n            const ex = lw / 2;\n            const ey = lh;\n\n            laserTime += 0.004;\n            const pulse = Math.sin(laserTime * 3) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n\n            // Base atmospheric bloom (haze)\n            const hazeRadius = 700 + pulse * 150;\n            const hazeGrad = lCtx.createRadialGradient(ex, ey, 0, ex, ey, hazeRadius);\n            hazeGrad.addColorStop(0, `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${0.1 + pulse * 0.02})`);\n            hazeGrad.addColorStop(0.3, `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${0.03 + pulse * 0.01})`);\n            hazeGrad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)');\n\n            lCtx.fillStyle = hazeGrad;\n            lCtx.beginPath();\n            lCtx.arc(ex, ey, hazeRadius, Math.PI, Math.PI * 2); // Top half only\n            lCtx.fill();\n\n            // Intense core hotspot flare\n            const flareRadius = 120 + pulse * 40;\n            const flareGrad = lCtx.createRadialGradient(ex, ey, 0, ex, ey, flareRadius);\n            flareGrad.addColorStop(0, `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95)`);\n            flareGrad.addColorStop(0.2, `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)`);\n            flareGrad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)');\n\n            lCtx.fillStyle = flareGrad;\n            lCtx.beginPath();\n            lCtx.arc(ex, ey, flareRadius, Math.PI, Math.PI * 2);\n            lCtx.fill();\n\n            // 3 Asymmetric structural beams\n            const beams = [\n                { angle: -Math.PI * 0.85, length: lw * 1.5, thickness: 1.5, jitter: 0.015, intensity: 0.85 },\n                { angle: -Math.PI * 0.58, length: lw * 1.8, thickness: 2.5, jitter: 0.008, intensity: 1.0 },\n                { angle: -Math.PI * 0.22, length: lw * 1.5, thickness: 1.0, jitter: 0.025, intensity: 0.7 }\n            ];\n\n            beams.forEach((beam, i) => {\n                const waver = Math.sin(laserTime * 5 + i * 2) * beam.jitter;\n                const finalAngle = beam.angle + waver;\n\n                const tx = ex + Math.cos(finalAngle) * beam.length;\n                const ty = ey + Math.sin(finalAngle) * beam.length;\n\n                const beamPulse = Math.sin(laserTime * 4 + i) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                const currentIntensity = beam.intensity * (0.8 + beamPulse * 0.2);\n\n                // Outer Halo\n                const haloGrad = lCtx.createLinearGradient(ex, ey, tx, ty);\n                haloGrad.addColorStop(0, `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${0.25 * currentIntensity})`);\n                haloGrad.addColorStop(0.5, `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${0.03 * currentIntensity})`);\n                haloGrad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)');\n\n                lCtx.beginPath();\n                lCtx.moveTo(ex, ey);\n                lCtx.lineTo(tx, ty);\n                lCtx.strokeStyle = haloGrad;\n                lCtx.lineWidth = beam.thickness * 14;\n                lCtx.lineCap = 'round';\n                lCtx.stroke();\n\n                // Bright Core\n                const coreGrad = lCtx.createLinearGradient(ex, ey, tx, ty);\n                coreGrad.addColorStop(0, `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${1.0 * currentIntensity})`);\n                coreGrad.addColorStop(0.6, `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${0.1 * currentIntensity})`);\n                coreGrad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)');\n\n                lCtx.beginPath();\n                lCtx.moveTo(ex, ey);\n                lCtx.lineTo(tx, ty);\n                lCtx.strokeStyle = coreGrad;\n                lCtx.lineWidth = beam.thickness;\n                lCtx.stroke();\n            });\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(drawLasers);\n        }\n\n        drawLasers();\n\n        // --- GSAP Motion Sequence ---\n        gsap.to(\"#hero-bg\", {\n            scale: 1,\n            duration: 10,\n            ease: \"power1.out\"\n        });\n\n        gsap.from(\".gsap-reveal\", {\n            y: \"110%\",\n            duration: 1.2,\n            stagger: 0.15,\n            ease: \"power3.out\",\n            delay: 0.2\n        });\n\n        gsap.from(\".gsap-fade\", {\n            opacity: 0,\n            y: 10,\n            duration: 1.5,\n            stagger: 0.2,\n            ease: \"power2.out\",\n            delay: 0.8\n        });\n\n        gsap.from(\".gsap-fade-up\", {\n            opacity: 0,\n            y: 30,\n            duration: 1.5,\n            ease: \"power2.out\",\n            delay: 1.2\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nodal-autonomous-relays.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nodal-autonomous-relays.jpg", "source_name": "nodal-autonomous-relays-DESIGN.md", "views": 86, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T04:26:03.644036+00:00"}